    "sp_label": {
      "type": "sp-accordion",
      "settings": {
        "anchor": "label",
        "eyebrow": "标签",
        "eyebrow_en": "The label",
        "eyebrow_pt": "O rótulo"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "sp_label_b0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "open": true,
            "heading": "配料",
            "heading_en": "Ingredients",
            "heading_pt": "Ingredientes",
            "body": "<p>水、猴面包树果浆。</p>",
            "body_en": "<p>Water, baobab fruit pulp.</p>",
            "body_pt": "<p>Água, polpa de múcua.</p>",
            "fn": "就这两行。",
            "fn_en": "Contains 82% juice. No added sugars*. Not a low calorie food; see nutrition information for sugar and calorie content.",
            "fn_pt": "Sem açúcares adicionados. Só estas duas linhas."
          }
        },
        "sp_label_b1": {
          "type": "nutrition",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "营养成分（美国标签原样）",
            "heading_en": "Nutrition Facts",
            "heading_pt": "Informação nutricional (rótulo EUA)",
            "body": "",
            "body_en": "",
            "body_pt": "",
            "fn": "每支约 10 千卡、膳食纤维 3 g、钾 160 mg、钠未检出；总多酚约 140 mg/支（欧陆成品实测）。",
            "fn_en": "Excellent source of fiber and good source of potassium per 240 mL reference amount (21 CFR 101.12). About 140 mg total polyphenols per shot, Eurofins finished-product analysis.",
            "fn_pt": "Por dose: cerca de 10 kcal, 3 g de fibra, 160 mg de potássio, sódio não detetado; cerca de 140 mg de polifenóis totais (análise Eurofins ao produto acabado)."
          }
        },
        "sp_label_b2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "储存",
            "heading_en": "Storage",
            "heading_pt": "Conservação",
            "body": "<p>未开封保质期 18 个月。阴凉干燥避光保存。开封后冷藏并尽快饮用。冷藏后更好喝。</p>",
            "body_en": "<p>Shelf life 18 months unopened. Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight. Refrigerate after opening and drink promptly. Best served chilled.</p>",
            "body_pt": "<p>Validade de 18 meses por abrir. Guardar em local fresco e seco, ao abrigo da luz. Refrigerar depois de aberto e consumir rapidamente. Melhor bem fresca.</p>",
            "fn": "",
            "fn_en": "",
            "fn_pt": ""
          }
        },
        "sp_label_b3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "怎么喝",
            "heading_en": "How to drink",
            "heading_pt": "Como beber",
            "body": "<p>摇匀。纤维会沉底，那是里面真有果实的证据。开盖，喝完，结束。早晨随早餐，或任何你想来一支的时候。</p>",
            "body_en": "<p>Shake well. The fiber settles at the bottom, and that's the proof there's fruit in here. Open, drink, done. Morning with breakfast, or whenever you'd reach for a shot.</p>",
            "body_pt": "<p>Agite bem. A fibra assenta no fundo, e essa é a prova de que há fruto aqui dentro. Abrir, beber, pronto. De manhã com o pequeno-almoço, ou sempre que lhe apetecer uma dose.</p>",
            "fn": "",
            "fn_en": "",
            "fn_pt": ""
          }
        },
        "sp_label_b4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "在哪里生产？",
            "heading_en": "Where is it made?",
            "heading_pt": "Onde é feita?",
            "body": "<p>果浆在非洲野生采集。Shot 在越南一家持有 BRCGS A+ 与 FSSC 22000 认证、已在美国 FDA 注册的工厂巴氏杀菌并玻璃瓶灌装。我们主动写在这里，你不用去标签上找。</p>",
            "body_en": "<p>The pulp is wild-harvested in Africa. The Shot is pasteurized and bottled in glass in Vietnam, at a facility holding BRCGS Grade A+ and FSSC 22000 certification and registered with the FDA. We say this here so you don't have to find it on the label.</p>",
            "body_pt": "<p>A polpa é colhida na natureza em África. A dose é pasteurizada e engarrafada em vidro no Vietname, numa fábrica com certificação BRCGS Grau A+ e FSSC 22000, registada na FDA. Dizemo-lo aqui para não ter de o procurar no rótulo.</p>",
            "fn": "",
            "fn_en": "",
            "fn_pt": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "sp_label_b0",
        "sp_label_b1",
        "sp_label_b2",
        "sp_label_b3",
        "sp_label_b4"
      ]
    },
